  _name: Quiet the Hounds
  _description: Kill 5 Brotherhood Hounds
  _storyDescription: The Dark Brotherhood has set its hounds loose near the outskirts. Deal with them before they find another trail.
  _activeQuestDialogue: 'The Brotherhood hounds are still on the outskirts. Please deal with them before they catch another scent.'
  _turnInDialogue: 'The hounds are no longer hunting near our homes. You have made the outskirts safer for everyone. Thank you.'
  _completedQuestDialogueLines:
  - 'The hounds are gone, and the villagers can walk the outskirts again. Thank you.'
  - 'It is quiet outside tonight. I had forgotten how welcome that could be.'
  - 'You kept those beasts away from our homes. I will remember it.'
